        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SER100SBR, Brass Sierra Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sierra Brass Pull is a mitered door handle that is available in 3 sizes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch overall lengths. This Modern Brass Sierra Door Pull is available in a wide selection of finish color options. It is made in the U.S.A. and the quality shows in the craftsmanship. The Sierra 2 Door Pull can be mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. Select thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order two pulls if you want them back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SER100SBR Sierra Handles:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SER02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262416\"><b>First Impressions SER100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>SER100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>SER100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 23\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>SER100036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 35\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sierra Brass Pull",
                "description": "The Sierra Brass Pull is a mitered door handle that is available in 3 sizes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch overall lengths. This Modern Brass Sierra Door Pull is available in a wide selection of finish color options. It is made in the U.S.A. and the quality shows in the craftsmanship. The Sierra 2 Door Pull can be mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. Select thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order two pulls if you want them back-to-back mounted.",
                "keywords": "First Impressions SER02, Brass Sierra Door Pulls, Sierra Brass Pulls,  First Impressions SER02, FII-SER02,  modern square door pulls, 12 inch door pulls, 24 inch door pulls, 36 inch door pulls, mitered square door pulls, contemporary door pulls, Modern Sierra Door Pulls, First Impressions SER02 Sierra Handles,"
